<Case
  title="Assessing to Decide (PhD Thesis)"
  description="Multi-criteria Consequential Life Cycle Assessment (cLCA) of integrating Artificial Intelligence into enterprise business service processes."
>
  <h2>Doctoral Research Scope &amp; Open Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Conducted over 5 years at the LISTIC laboratory (Université Savoie Mont Blanc) in conjunction with enterprise banking software architecture at SBS, this doctoral research investigates how AI integration transforms business service workflows and their multi-criteria environmental footprint (GWP, AFP/ADP, water, energy).
  </p>
  <p>
    This page outlines the methodological orientation of the thesis. It does not claim unvalidated empirical results prior to peer review.
  </p>
